[1m[35m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════[0m
[1m[35m ACT I — What is TraceMind?[0m
[1m[35m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════[0m

[1m[36m▸ The pitch[0m
[2mTraceMind is a local-only memory OS. Everything you're about to see runs on this laptop: real ONNX embeddings (BGE-small-384d), a SQLite graph, a JTMS truth-maintenance layer, ambient capture, tiered answers, and an MCP surface that plugs into Claude Code / Cursor / Goose. No cloud, no telemetry, ~/.tracemind/ is the whole footprint.[0m

[33m$ ./target/release/tracemind onboard --dry-run[0m
[tracemind] using bundled models from /Users/aadityasrivathsan/Desktop/agent_memory_system/target/release/models (bundle)
TraceMind onboarding
  data dir: /tmp/tm-demo-tour
  memory.db: not yet
  model bge-384-v1.5          : missing (will download on first use)
  model gliner-multi          : missing (will download on first use)
  model mxbai-colbert         : missing (will download on first use)
  entities in graph: 0
  unconsolidated signals: 0
  onboarding marker: not written (dry run)

[1m[35m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════[0m
[1m[35m ACT II — Ingestion, every shape[0m
[1m[35m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════[0m

[1m[36m▸ 1. Text ingest[0m
[2mPlain text goes through governance (regex PII + confidence gate) → heuristic NER (URLs, emails, dates, entity typing) → SQLite graph upsert → BGE embedding → immutable Trace event.[0m

[33m$ ./target/release/tracemind ingest 'Aaditya founded TraceMind in Palo Alto in July 2026. The company builds a local memory OS.'[0m
[tracemind] using bundled models from /Users/aadityasrivathsan/Desktop/agent_memory_system/target/release/models (bundle)
Ingested: "Aaditya founded TraceMind in Palo Alto in July 2026. The company builds a local ..."
  Trace:    1689c99e-797b-45bc-acc6-ac025e55f239
  Entities: 4
    [Person] Aaditya
    [Concept] TraceMind
    [Location] Palo Alto
    [Event] July 2026
  Typed triples:
    Aaditya -> Owns -> TraceMind
  + 0 co-occurrence triples

[1m[36m▸ 2. URL ingest (browser-shaped)[0m
[2mURLs get first-class treatment: raw URL becomes a Url entity AND the registrable domain becomes an Organization node. That means a query for 'FIFA' hits the graph directly, not just BGE similarity.[0m

[2m$ tracemind ingest "https://www.fifa.com/tickets FIFA World Cup 2026 Tickets"[0m
