[1m[36m▸ 11. Contexts — decoupled by default (C-0)[0m
[2mNamed namespaces. Every signal + triple inherits the active context_id at ingest time. Retrieval defaults to the active scope. The point: your local machine has MORE context blur than a browser — decoupling is the wedge.[0m

