[1m[35m ACT V — Contradictions + retraction beat (JTMS)[0m
[1m[35m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════[0m

[1m[36m▸ 15. The retraction beat (JTMS supersession)[0m
[2mIngest two conflicting facts with the same subject + predicate. The JTMS truth-maintenance layer detects the collision and the retraction beat surfaces a one-line reconcile message on the newer belief — memory doesn't silently accumulate contradictions.[0m

[33m$ ./target/release/tracemind ingest 'FIFA World Cup 2026 final located in New Jersey'[0m
[tracemind] using bundled models from /Users/aadityasrivathsan/Desktop/agent_memory_system/target/release/models (bundle)
Ingested: "FIFA World Cup 2026 final located in New Jersey"
  Trace:    cb3bdfef-5758-4ade-84de-72f65d1b2382
  Entities: 2
    [Organization] FIFA
    [Location] New Jersey
  Typed triples:
    FIFA -> located_in -> New Jersey
  + 0 co-occurrence triples

[33m$ ./target/release/tracemind ingest 'FIFA World Cup 2026 final located in Los Angeles'[0m
[tracemind] using bundled models from /Users/aadityasrivathsan/Desktop/agent_memory_system/target/release/models (bundle)
Ingested: "FIFA World Cup 2026 final located in Los Angeles"
  Trace:    1a6e1887-7399-4ce8-b1c0-a6c018935ed3
  Entities: 2
    [Organization] FIFA
    [Location] Los Angeles
  Typed triples:
    FIFA -> located_in -> Los Angeles
  + 0 co-occurrence triples
  ⚠ Retraction:
    You told me FIFA located in New Jersey, but now it's Los Angeles.

[32m» Watch the second ingest — the ⚠ Retraction line above is the beat firing. That message is what the MCP host / Tauri brief also shows.[0m

[33m$ ./target/release/tracemind contradictions list[0m
