[1m[35m ACT VI — System of Intents[0m
[1m[35m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════[0m

[1m[36m▸ 16. Commit an intent[0m
[2mThe wedge primitive of the intent system. A Commitment has kind (intent/decision/hypothesis), horizon, stakes, and expected outcome. Everything downstream — outcomes, patterns, insights, the world model — hangs off this.[0m

[33m$ ./target/release/tracemind commit --kind intent 'buy Group Stage tickets before the price surge' --stakes high --horizon 2026-08-15T00:00:00Z --no-preflight[0m
