[1m[36m▸ 19. One primitive, every LLM host[0m
[2mThis is the innovation: memory_context_for(topic, budget) — a token-budgeted, cited context brief bindable to one keystroke in Claude Code / Cursor / Goose / Windsurf. Same primitive on the MCP surface. What follows is the CLI mirror.[0m

[33m$ ./target/release/tracemind context-for 'world cup tickets' --budget-tokens 500[0m
