[1m[36m▸ 22. Retrieval policy — GEPA-tuned, promotable[0m
[2mThe GEPA loop runs against the real stack and produces a candidate RetrievalPolicy (ComposedIndex weights + score floor + answer weights). tracemind policy set <report> promotes it in-place. tracemind rollback list reverses any promotion.[0m

