[1m[36m▸ That was TraceMind.[0m
[2mLocal-only memory OS. Ambient ingestion (text/URL/bulk/browser/screenshot). Bandit-routed retrieval + tiered answers + immutable trace log. Graph features: backlinks / contexts / views / pending / today. Contradictions with a retraction beat. System of Intents. Composition primitive for every MCP host. Nightly on-device self-improvement. Full export. Every byte stayed on this laptop.[0m
